 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "In Birchwater, nobody says their real name aloud.",
   "tag": "[mysterious]",
   "pause": 0.12
  },
  {
   "text": "Even the barber just goes by Snips.",
   "tag": "[amused]",
   "pause": 0.12
  },
  {
   "text": "Because a postman made of bark lives in the birches.",
   "tag": "[ominous]",
   "pause": 0.12
  },
  {
   "text": "If he hears your real name, he posts it. Then you're forgotten.",
   "tag": "[hushed]",
   "pause": 0.12
  },
  {
   "text": "Kit's sister went by Sparrow.",
   "tag": "[warm]",
   "pause": 0.12
  },
  {
   "text": "One Sunday, a van rolled down the hill at their baby brother.",
   "tag": "[tense]",
   "pause": 0.12
  },
  {
   "text": "Sparrow got there first.",
   "tag": "[urgent]",
   "pause": 0.14
  },
  {
   "text": "“Marigold!”",
   "tag": "[screaming]",
   "pause": 0.12,
   "voice": "mom",
   "speak": "MARIGOLD!"
  },
  {
   "text": "In the birches, a quill scratched.",
   "tag": "[whispering]",
   "pause": 0.14
  },
  {
   "text": "“Who are you? Put my baby down!”",
   "tag": "[cold, frightened]",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "voice": "mom",
   "speak": "Who are you? Put my baby down!"
  },
  {
   "text": "Only Kit remembered. He'd been mowing in ear defenders.",
   "tag": "[serious]",
   "pause": 0.12
  },
  {
   "text": "That night, he followed the scratching into the birches.",
   "tag": "[hurried]",
   "pause": 0.12
  },
  {
   "text": "Thousands of postcards hung between the trees. The newest said Marigold.",
   "tag": "[hushed]",
   "pause": 0.12
  },
  {
   "text": "Kit grabbed it. A cold hand closed on his wrist.",
   "tag": "[tense]",
   "pause": 0.14
  },
  {
   "text": "“What is posted, stays posted.”",
   "tag": "[low, creaky]",
   "pause": 0.14,
   "voice": "postman",
   "speak": "What is posted, stays posted."
  },
  {
   "text": "“Then post a different name.”",
   "tag": "[determined]",
   "pause": 0.14,
   "voice": "kit",
   "speak": "Then post a different name."
  },
  {
   "text": "Kit wrote his own name on a fresh card, and fed hers to the lantern.",
   "tag": "[steady]",
   "pause": 0.12
  },
  {
   "text": "The postman tipped his cap.",
   "tag": "[quiet]",
   "pause": 0.12
  },
  {
   "text": "At sunrise, Mom was braiding Sparrow's hair.",
   "tag": "[warm]",
   "pause": 0.14
  },
  {
   "text": "“Oh! Are you lost, sweetheart?”",
   "tag": "[politely]",
   "pause": 0.12,
   "voice": "mom",
   "speak": "Oh! Are you lost, sweetheart?"
  },
  {
   "text": "Kit lives in the treehouse now. Sparrow leaves him cocoa every night.",
   "tag": "[tender]",
   "pause": 0.12
  },
  {
   "text": "She doesn't know why. He never tells her.",
   "tag": "[warm]",
   "pause": 0.12
  }
 ],
